flowchart TD
    A[Parent/Guardian Login<br/>/login?role=parent] --> B{Auth Check}
    B -->|Valid| C[Guardian Portal: /parent]
    B -->|Invalid| A

    C --> D{Ward Selector}
    D -->|Multiple Wards| E[Dropdown: Select Ward]
    E --> F[Set Active Ward Context]
    D -->|Single Ward| F

    F --> G{Parent Dashboard Tabs}

    %% Live Ward Status Flow
    G -->|Click Live Status Tab| H1[Load Ward Status<br/>GET /api/parent/ward/:wardId/status]
    H1 --> I1[Ward Profile Card<br/>Photo, Name, Roll No, Branch]
    I1 --> J1{Check Ward State}
    J1 -->|IN CAMPUS| K1[Status Badge: Inside Campus]
    K1 --> L1[Entry Details<br/>Last Entry Gate, Time]
    L1 --> M1[Campus Map Pin<br/>Last Known Location]
    
    J1 -->|OUT OF CAMPUS| K2[Status Badge: Outside Campus]
    K2 --> L2[Active Pass Card<br/>Pass Type, Destination, Return Time]
    L2 --> M2[Timer: Expected Return In X Hours]
    
    J1 -->|HOSTEL| K3[Status Badge: In Hostel]
    K3 --> L3[Hostel Details<br/>Block, Room, Warden Name]
    L3 --> M3[Curfew Status: Safe / Late Warning]

    %% Pass Management Flow
    G -->|Click Passes Tab| H2[Load Pass Requests<br/>GET /api/parent/ward/:wardId/passes]
    H2 --> I2[Pass Cards Grid<br/>Pending, Active, History]
    I2 --> J2[Filter by Status<br/>Pending Approval / Active / Completed]
    J2 --> K4{Click Pass Card}
    
    K4 -->|Pending Pass| L4[Pass Detail Modal]
    L4 --> M4[Pass Info<br/>Date, Time, Destination, Reason]
    M4 --> N1{Guardian Action Buttons}
    N1 -->|Approve| O1[Confirm Approval Dialog]
    O1 --> P1[POST /api/passes/:passId/approve]
    P1 --> Q1[Success Toast: Pass Approved]
    Q1 --> R1[Notification Sent to Ward]
    R1 --> H2
    
    N1 -->|Reject| O2[Rejection Reason Modal]
    O2 --> P2[Text Input: Reason for Rejection]
    P2 --> Q2[POST /api/passes/:passId/reject]
    Q2 --> R2[Ward Notified: Pass Rejected]
    R2 --> H2
    
    N1 -->|Request Changes| O3[Comment Modal]
    O3 --> P3[POST /api/passes/:passId/comment]
    
    K4 -->|Active Pass| L5[Active Pass QR Code Display]
    L5 --> M5[Real-time Tracking<br/>If Ward Scanned Out]
    
    %% Create Emergency Pass Flow
    G -->|Click Create Emergency Pass| H3[Emergency Pass Form<br/>/parent/passes/create]
    H3 --> I3[Fill Form<br/>Reason, Pickup Time, Contact Number]
    I3 --> J3[Select Pass Type<br/>Medical Emergency / Family Emergency]
    J3 --> K5[Click Submit Button]
    K5 --> L6[POST /api/passes/emergency/create]
    L6 --> M6[Pass Created Instantly<br/>No Additional Approval Needed]
    M6 --> N2[QR Code Generated]
    N2 --> O4[SMS/WhatsApp to Ward & Parent]
    O4 --> H2

    %% Movement History Flow
    G -->|Click History Tab| H4[Load Movement Log<br/>GET /api/parent/ward/:wardId/history]
    H4 --> I4[Timeline View<br/>Entry/Exit Records]
    I4 --> J4[Each Entry Shows<br/>Date, Time, Gate, Direction, Operator]
    J4 --> K6{Filter Options}
    K6 -->|Date Range| L7[Date Picker -> Refetch]
    K6 -->|Gate Filter| L8[Dropdown -> Refetch]
    K6 -->|Export Report| L9[Click Export Button]
    L9 --> M7[Select Format<br/>PDF / Excel / CSV]
    M7 --> N3[GET /api/parent/ward/:wardId/history/export]
    N3 --> O5[Download File]

    %% Notifications & Alerts Flow
    G -->|Click Notifications Tab| H5[Load Alerts<br/>GET /api/parent/notifications]
    H5 --> I5[Notification Cards<br/>Gate Scans, Pass Updates, Alerts]
    I5 --> J5[Real-time Updates<br/>WebSocket Connection]
    J5 --> K7{Notification Types}
    K7 -->|Gate Scan| L10[Ward Entered/Exited Campus<br/>Gate Name, Time, Photo]
    K7 -->|Pass Approved| L11[Pass Request Approved by Warden/HOD]
    K7 -->|Curfew Warning| L12[Ward Late / Curfew Breach Alert]
    K7 -->|Attendance Alert| L13[Ward Absent / Irregular Attendance]

    %% Settings Flow
    G -->|Click Settings Tab| H6[Parent Settings<br/>/parent/settings]
    H6 --> I6[Settings Form]
    I6 --> J6{Settings Sections}
    J6 -->|Notification Preferences| K8[Toggle Switches]
    K8 --> L14[SMS Notifications ON/OFF]
    L14 --> M8[WhatsApp Notifications ON/OFF]
    M8 --> N4[Push Notifications ON/OFF]
    N4 --> O6[Email Digest ON/OFF]
    
    J6 -->|Emergency Contacts| K9[Add/Edit Contacts]
    K9 --> L15[Contact Form<br/>Name, Relation, Phone]
    L15 --> M9[Click Save]
    M9 --> N5[POST /api/parent/contacts/save]
    
    J6 -->|Language & Timezone| K10[Dropdowns]
    K10 --> L16[Save Preferences]
    L16 --> M10[PATCH /api/parent/settings]

    %% Multi-Ward Switcher
    C --> X[Top Nav: Ward Switcher]
    X --> Y[Dropdown: All Wards List]
    Y --> Z[Click Ward Name]
    Z --> F

    %% Logout Flow
    C --> V1[Profile Menu -> Logout]
    V1 --> V2[POST /api/auth/logout]
    V2 --> V3[Clear Session]
    V3 --> A
